WEBVTT

00:00:58.197 --> 00:01:00.263
the major auction house Christie's

00:01:00.263 --> 00:01:03.997
sold a purely digital artwork
by an artist named Beeple

00:01:04.030 --> 00:01:06.830
for 69 million dollars in cryptocurrency.

00:01:07.363 --> 00:01:12.063
The auction, the artwork
and the currency was virtual,

00:01:12.097 --> 00:01:13.863
but the transaction was very real.

00:01:14.297 --> 00:01:15.930
But who can afford a Beeple?

00:01:16.363 --> 00:01:17.497
Don't worry,

00:01:17.530 --> 00:01:20.030
there are lots of artists
creating digital art

00:01:20.030 --> 00:01:22.663
and conceptualizing brand new art forms

00:01:22.697 --> 00:01:24.063
that you can afford.

00:01:24.630 --> 00:01:27.130
I direct Media Entrepreneurship
and Innovation

00:01:27.163 --> 00:01:29.497
at the Creative Media Industries Institute

00:01:29.497 --> 00:01:31.697
at Georgia State University,